        "originalText": {
          "text": "地方寬敞，泰國風情，侍應服務貼心\n\n有新派泰式料理及傳統泰國菜選擇，今次揀咗傳統泰國菜。\n\n餐廳裝修好有泰國嘅氣氛，有室內室外內餐，仲有男女泰服可以影相打卡而且播住泰文歌，好似置身泰國，都幾好玩！\n\n生蝦刺身\n唔算大隻，口感彈牙\n\n燒牛舌芯\n燒到岩岩好，肉質爽嫩彈牙，泰式辣汁及沙嗲汁惹味\n\n冬陰功（3-4人份）\n蝦唔算大隻，配料唔算多，但都好飲，唔會太辣太鹹。\n\n咖喱牛肋條金磚包\n咖喱偏稀，甜甜地，適合小朋友食。\n\n辣椒膏炒蜆\n蜆夠大隻",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "wong tiffany",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107202994685744112034/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIRRR-iYG4IGPJl9WM9IMWS1DD-coTWuO1Pot8xvKmx_9FAEw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-01-19T02:20:56.450622352Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WSFJWUlZjbE01Vm5Kd0xXY3dhM1JST1RVNE1tYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WSFJWUlZjbE01Vm5Kd0xXY3dhM1JST1RVNE1tYxAB!2m1!1s0x3403fb27952d07c3:0xd6b7386fabb497f1"
